HB0284 Required hospital services.
Sponsored By: Representative(s) Provenza, Larsen, L, Strock and
Wharff and Senator(s) Barlow, Brennan, Gierau and
Schuler
AN ACT relating to public health and safety; requiring hospitals licensed by
the department of health to provide specified services; authorizing hospitals
to apply to the department of health to waive obstetrics, labor and delivery
services as specified; making conforming amendments; and providing for an
effective date.
